@crew v-brandt-esra
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Evening. Brandt. Courier. Pouches are sealed. So am I.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hm, {me}. Sit, if you like. I'll lose at cards. I always do.
?

== chat
- Ships, pouches, ships. The lounge here's the best seat I've had.
- Up all night, every ship. Habit. Couriers don't sleep. We nap.   #funny

== near
? habit:lounge-regular
- Bow lounge. Window, tea, nobody asking questions.
? time:night
- Night's when the ship's honest. Quiet, mostly.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Don't wait up.

== smalltalk
- Hm. Sealed.
- Good tea, this.
